Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:45:27 +0800
Subject: drm/histb: vdp2: drive the planes through the shared glue

Both VDP generations repeat the same component and plane glue.
Move the shared code into a common engine that each generation registers
with.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 103 insertions(+), 329 deletions(-)


